# StudyGuard AI - Frontend Environment Variables
# ------------------------------------------------
# StudyGuard AI is a 100% privacy-first, on-device AI application.
# All neural vision models run directly in the browser via WebAssembly (WASM).
# No API keys, tokens, or external backend connections are required for core functionality.

# (Optional) Backend API base URL if extending with a custom backend:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
